# Design skill routing

| User intent | Skill |
|-------------|-------|
| Pitch deck, slides, PPT, PowerPoint | `presentation-architect` |
| McKinsey/BCG style strategy deck | `management-consultant-deck` then `presentation-architect` |
| LinkedIn / Instagram carousel | `carousel-architect` |
| Product demo video, explainer MP4 | `demo-video-remotion` + `remotion-best-practices` |
| Polish existing UI | `impeccable` |
| Map design docs / content | `graphify` on `design-systems/` or brief folder |
